<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Laverton sees Rawas gold pour soon.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Laverton sees Rawas gold pour soon.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laverton Gold NL said the maiden gold pour from its Rawas gold project in Sumatra, Indonesia will occur in about two weeks.</p>
<p>The project was commissioned on January 5 and was running at a rate of 70 tonnes of or hour per hour, equivalent to 600,000 tonnes a year, Laverton said in a statement.</p>
</text>
